results.description:
Handy and simple counter for counting with widget, in which there is no advertising. 
The maximum value of the counter reaches 9999.
The minimum value of the counter reaches -999. 

- A handy widget;
- 3D Touch Quick Actions;
- Possibility to set the counter step;
- Negative values;
- On / off sounds in the application;
- On / off vibration in the application;

A nice and convenient application in which you can conduct personal calculations. For example: the number of passengers, the number of people at the entrance, the number of approaches, the number of clouds, the number of drinking glasses of water and so on ...
